  "html": "<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><title>AbarVa notification</title></head><body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#F1EFE8;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;background:#F1EFE8;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="620" style="border-collapse:collapse;max-width:620px;width:100%;background:#F8F7F4;border:1px solid #E5E1D8;"><tr><td><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td style="padding:24px 24px 18px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #E5E1D8;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td align="left" style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:18px;color:#1A1A1A;letter-spacing:0.02em;">AbarVa</td><td align="right" style="font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#5B6C8A;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;">Apex Retail · Retail</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:28px 28px 8px 28px;"><h1 style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#1A1A1A;">We detected a cross-tenant resolution mismatch</h1><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1A1A;">Our isolation resolver returned a different tenant context than the caller requested. The request was halted before any data left the tenant boundary; this email exists so your audit chain stays complete.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;background:#F1EFE8;border:1px solid #E5E1D8;margin:12px 0 18px 0;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 18px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#5B6C8A;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;width:40%;vertical-align:top;">Severity</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A1A1A;vertical-align:top;">Critical</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#5B6C8A;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;width:40%;vertical-align:top;">Detector</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A1A1A;vertical-align:top;">rls.cross_tenant_read</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#5B6C8A;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;width:40%;vertical-align:top;">Intended tenant</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A1A1A;vertical-align:top;">apex-retail</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#5B6C8A;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;width:40%;vertical-align:top;">Resolved tenant</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A1A1A;vertical-align:top;">meridian-health</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#5B6C8A;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;width:40%;vertical-align:top;">Detected</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A1A1A;vertical-align:top;">30 May 2026 · 14:02 UTC</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:18px 0 6px 0;"><tr><td style="background:#1A1A1A;border-radius:2px;"><a href="/admin/audit?tab=isolation" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#F8F7F4;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.02em;">Open Isolation lane</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1A1A1A;">This event also appears in your tenant audit log under detector <code style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#1A1A1A;">rls.cross_tenant_read</code>. No tenant-scoped data was disclosed.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:28px 28px 24px 28px;border-top:1px solid #E5E1D8;font-family:'DM Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#5B6C8A;"><p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;">AbarVa, Inc. · [address TBD] · Phase 1 placeholder</p><p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;">You're receiving this because you are a tenant admin subscribed to isolation.anomaly events for this workspace.</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;"><a href="/admin/users-access/notifications" style="color:#1A1A1A;text-decoration:underline;">Manage notification preferences</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="/admin/users-access/notifications" style="color:#1A1A1A;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;color:#5B6C8A;">Sent at 30 May 2026 · 14:02 UTC · event evt_isolation_demo_1 · ts 2026-05-30T14:02:00.000Z</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "subject": "[Apex Retail] Tenant isolation anomaly detected",
  "text": "Apex Retail · Retail
Tenant isolation anomaly detected

Our isolation resolver returned a different tenant context than the caller requested. The request was halted before any data left the tenant boundary; this email exists so your audit chain stays complete.

Severity: Critical
Detector: rls.cross_tenant_read
Intended tenant: apex-retail
Resolved tenant: meridian-health
Detected: 30 May 2026 · 14:02 UTC

Open Isolation lane: /admin/audit?tab=isolation

This event also appears in your tenant audit log under detector rls.cross_tenant_read. No tenant-scoped data was disclosed.

---
AbarVa, Inc. · [address TBD] · Phase 1 placeholder
You're receiving this because you are a tenant admin subscribed to isolation.anomaly events for this workspace.
Manage preferences or unsubscribe: /admin/users-access/notifications
Sent at 30 May 2026 · 14:02 UTC · event evt_isolation_demo_1 · ts 2026-05-30T14:02:00.000Z",
}
`;

